{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，晉侯使韓穿來言汶陽之田歸之于齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"來言者何？內辭也，脅我使我歸之也。曷為使我歸之？鞌之戰，齊師大敗，齊侯歸，弔死視疾，七年不飲酒不食肉。晉侯聞之曰：「嘻！奈何使人之君七年不飲酒不食肉，請皆反其所取侵地。」","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"二、晉欒書帥師侵蔡。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"三、公孫嬰齊如莒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"四、宋公使華元來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"五、夏，宋公使公孫壽來納幣。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"納幣不書，此何以書？錄伯姬也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"六、晉殺其大夫趙同、趙括。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"七、秋七月，天子使召伯來錫公命。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"其稱天子何？元年春王正月，正也，其餘皆通矣。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"八、冬十月癸卯，〈木巳〉叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"九、晉侯使士爕來聘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"十、叔孫僑如會晉士爕、齊人、邾婁人伐郯。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"十一、衞人來媵。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_140_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_140","textTraditional":"媵不書，此何以書？錄伯姬也。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}